  "text": "Sikkim Tours - India | Prestige Holidays 4U Prestige Holidays 4U Where Great Journey Begins Home Domestic International Packages Customize Trip About Contact +91 63618 77187 Domestic Sikkim India Himalayan paradise with Buddhist monasteries and mountain views Why Visit Sikkim? Sikkim, nestled in the Eastern Himalayas, is a pristine mountain state offering breathtaking views of Kanchenjunga, the third highest peak in the world. Explore ancient Buddhist monasteries, trek through rhododendron forests, and experience the warm hospitality of local communities. From the scenic Tsomgo Lake to the vibrant capital Gangtok, Sikkim offers peace and adventure in equal measure. Best Time to Visit March to June, September to December Top Attractions Tsomgo Lake Nathula Pass Previous slide Next slide Tsomgo Lake Nathula Pass Rumtek Monastery Pelling with Kanchenjunga Views Gangtok Ropeway Yumthang Valley Activities & Experiences Mountain Trekking Monastery Visits Cable Car Rides River Rafting Bird Watching Local Culture Experience Plan Your Trip Enquire Now WhatsApp Us Contact Information Phone +91 63618 77187 Email showkath@prestigeholidays4u.com Prestige Holidays 4U Where Great Journey Begins Your trusted partner for domestic and international travel experiences. Creating memorable journeys since years. Quick Links Home Domestic Tours International Tours Tour Packages About Us Contact Us Popular Destinations Goa Kerala Maldives Dubai Switzerland Thailand Contact Info No 638/G, HBR 1st Stage, 2nd Block, HBR Layout, Karnataka, Bengaluru – 560043 +91 63618 77187 showkath@prestigeholidays4u.com © 2026 Prestige Holidays 4U. All rights reserved. Chat with us on WhatsApp"
